# Bootable images are published as release assets, not committed: the squashfs
# is several hundred megabytes and both files exceed GitHub's per-file limit for
# ordinary git objects. Build them with mksquashfs and xorriso, then upload:
#   gh release upload v0.1.0-rootfs rootfs/neptunium.iso rootfs/neptunium-rootfs.squashfs
